# MinIO stopped publishing free Docker images in October 2025 and removed the
# `minio/minio` repository from Docker Hub in September 2026. s3s therefore
# builds the last upstream state from source and publishes it to
# ghcr.io/s3s-project/minio (see the `s3s` branch of s3s-project/minio); that
# build carries the GHSA-jjjj-jwhf-8rgr fix and a streaming-flush patch, neither
# of which the last published image has. Override `MINIO_IMAGE_REF` to test
# another build.
MINIO_IMAGE_REF="${MINIO_IMAGE_REF:-ghcr.io/s3s-project/minio:202609131438@sha256:b63b72fe565affa96b60879a9e62ad6a3c86e58a78e52b071eb29d5a0d338477}"
